# The three modes (ARP). PLAY: the white keys play VOX in the scene's key; while they do (and four bars
# after) the generator's VOX waits, then its sparse phrases come back. GUIDE: held keys steer VOX's
# phrases. DRIFT: a white key is a scene, and the director travels there (the next scene's key comes
# in at the middle of the travel).
wait 1000
expect mode 0
expect jr_playing 1
turn K2 32
expect vox_notes >-1
tapkey w0
wait 100
expect vox 1
expect vox_notes 0
wait 9000
expect vox_notes 0
wait 40000
expect vox_notes >0
tap ARP
expect mode 1
key w8 down
key w10 down
wait 40000
expect vox_notes >1
key w8 up
key w10 up
tap ARP
expect mode 2
tapkey w2
wait 200
expect travelling 1
shot drift.png
leds
wait 30000
expect scene 3
tap ARP
expect mode 0
expect clips 0
